Here is a complete, self-contained HTML dashboard. It includes the analysis of the 5 papers, a visual chart of topics, and key takeaways.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Forest Fire Management Dashboard</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2c3e50;
            --secondary: #e74c3c;
            --accent: #27ae60;
            --bg: #f4f7f6;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text: #333333;
            --text-light: #7f8c8d;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--secondary);
            padding-left: 15px;
        }

        h3 {
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* Grid Layout */
        .dashboard-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .dashboard-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        /* Cards */
        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .card-header {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-right: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .tag-blue { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1565c0; }
        .tag-red { background: #ffebee; color: #c62828; }
        .tag-green { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }
        .tag-orange { background: #fff3e0; color: #ef6c00; }

        /* Theme Section */
        .theme-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .theme-list li {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-left: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .theme-list li::before {
            content: "•";
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: bold;
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
        }

        /* Disagreement Section */
        .disagreement-box {
            background-color: #fff8e1;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .disagreement-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #d35400;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        /* Chart Section */
        .chart-container {
            position: relative;
            height: 300px;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            justify-content: space-around;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }

        .bar-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            width: 15%;
            height: 100%;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .bar {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
            transition: height 1s ease-in-out;
            position: relative;
        }

        .bar:hover {
            background-color: var(--secondary);
        }

        .bar-label {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .bar-value {
            position: absolute;
            top: -25px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Paper Summary List */
        .paper-item {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
            padding: 15px 0;
        }
        .paper-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .paper-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        .paper-meta {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

